Z||000000||puter2k||03-15-2001||08:05 PM||||Is there anyone out there, that could give me the exact mounting hole locations, for the rear stock wing on an 88 GT ? I have an 88 GT that didn't come with a wing, and have been able to aquire an 88 OEM wing to put on it. I'm wanting to keep it ( factory stock ) for a car show coming soon.||||reg||1
Z||000001||danny boy||03-15-2001||09:14 PM||||Correct me if I'm wrong (I usually am) but here's what I think. Look on the bottom of the deck lid. right in front of the rear framework there is two rectangular indentions that go in.You'll see what I mean when you look.Those are where the holes should be. Place the spoiler on the top and you can see which ones I'm talking about. Hopefully this helps and made sense.I'm going by where mine is mounted.||||reg||1
